@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
allowmixing
title Proposed — Tangled versus owner-controlled dependencies
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Before: hypothetical poor boundaries" {
 component "Consumer A internals" as A
 component "Consumer B internals" as B
 component "Universal mutable manager" as H
 A -[#red]-> B
 B -[#red]-> A
 A --> H
 B --> H
}
package "After: candidate cohesive owner contract" {
 component "Consumer use case" as C
 interface "Owner public contract" as P
 component "Owner implementation\nlocal invariant and state" as O
 C --> P
 O ..|> P
}
note bottom of H
 Counterexample only: no measured cycle or hotspot finding.
 Fan-in alone is not bad coupling; Identity/Files may legitimately support many owners.
end note

@enduml